WEBVTT

00:04:30.607 --> 00:04:32.825
At some point today,
you brushed your teeth.

00:04:33.659 --> 00:04:34.811
I hope.

00:04:34.835 --> 00:04:36.095
(Laughter)

00:04:36.119 --> 00:04:37.708
This is tribology in action.

00:04:38.165 --> 00:04:40.998
The toothpaste and toothbrush
are working to remove or wear

00:04:41.022 --> 00:04:42.419
the plaque from your teeth.

00:04:43.561 --> 00:04:45.740
For the record, my dad is a dentist.

00:04:45.764 --> 00:04:49.173
Never thought my career was going
to circle back to the family business.

00:04:49.197 --> 00:04:51.982
But one day, we found ourselves
speaking the same language

00:04:52.006 --> 00:04:55.600
when I was tasked with developing a test
to investigate plaque removal.

00:04:56.087 --> 00:04:58.112
Sounded simple enough,

00:04:58.136 --> 00:05:00.505
until I started to look at it
as a tribologist,